            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-entity-intuition",
        "moduleId": "entity-integrity-concept",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "example",
        "title": "实体完整性的现实类比",
        "markdown": "实体完整性确保关系中的每个元组都是可区分的。可以把关系想象成一个班级花名册：\n\n- **学号**就是主码，每个学生必须有唯一的学号（非空且唯一）。\n- 如果允许学号为空，就无法区分两位没有学号的学生。\n- 如果允许学号重复，就无法通过学号精确定位到某一个学生。\n\n因此，实体完整性是关系数据库能够正确标识和操作每个元组的基础。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "tb-entity-definition"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "tb-entity-check",
        "moduleId": "entity-integrity-practice",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "mechanism",
        "title": "实体完整性检查与违约处理",
        "markdown": "当用户对基本表执行INSERT或UPDATE操作时，数据库管理系统会自动检查主码值是否唯一、是否为空。\n\n- 如果主码值为空，则拒绝执行该操作。\n- 如果主码值不唯一，则拒绝执行该操作。\n\n系统通过在主码上建立索引来高效完成唯一性检查。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-8786f8dd100c0d7af2538e79",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000319"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "数据库完整性",
                "实体完整性检查和违约处理"
              ],
              "lineStart": 5973,
              "lineEnd": 5993,
              "assetRefs": [
                "parts/part-0002/images/04dea00ed9e9d9f630bcd67c36b5aebbc8d0964916ebc65501e79110d5b0c3cb.jpg"
              ],
              "excerptSha256": "726ecdc509b853096709c7fb4789b09d5d5a95ff1a572f8fd2d08ab68569b449"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "tb-primary-key-sql",
        "moduleId": "entity-integrity-practice",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "code",
        "title": "PRIMARY KEY的定义",
        "markdown": "在SQL中，可以在CREATE TABLE语句中使用PRIMARY KEY短语定义实体完整性。\n\n单属性主码：\n\n```sql\nCREATE TABLE Student\n(  Sno CHAR(9) PRIMARY KEY,\n   Sname CHAR(20),\n   Ssex CHAR(2),\n   Sage SMALLINT,\n   Sdept CHAR(20)\n);\n```\n\n多属性主码（表级约束）：\n\n```sql\nCREATE TABLE SC\n(  Sno CHAR(9),\n   Cno CHAR(4),\n   Grade SMALLINT,\n   PRIMARY KEY (Sno, Cno)\n);\n```",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "tb-entity-definition",
            "tb-entity-check"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "exercise-entity-check",
        "moduleId": "check",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "exercise",
        "title": "实体完整性检查",
        "markdown": "判断以下说法是否正确：\n\n1. 实体完整性要求主码属性不能取空值。\n2. PRIMARY KEY约束只能在列级定义，不能在表级定义。\n3. 当INSERT语句导致主码重复时，系统会自动忽略该记录而不报错。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "tb-entity-definition",
            "tb-entity-check",
            "tb-primary-key-sql"
          ]
        }
      }
    ],
